  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">FAO Apell V&#xe4;stafrika 2011</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">FAO CAP West Africa 2011</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Huvudm&#xe5;let med insatsen var (i) att st&#xe4;rka samordning och information om livsmedelsf&#xf6;rs&#xf6;rjning i subregionen, till&#xe4;mpa advocacy f&#xf6;r         matprogram och l&#xe4;mpliga DRM tillv&#xe4;gag&#xe5;ngss&#xe4;tt, (ii)st&#xe4;rka kapaciteten i jordbruksproduktionen f&#xf6;r utsatta hush&#xe5;ll i Guinea, Guinea -Bissau  och Senegal som drabbats av livsmedelsotrygghet</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The specific objective of the project is to (i) strenghten            coordination and information on food security in the subregion, as    well as advocacy for food security programems and appropriate DRM     approaches; and (ii) strengthen the agricultural production of        vulnerable households affected by or at risk of food insecurity in    Guinea, Guinea-Bissau and Senegal.</narrative>
  </description>
